---
export const title = 'Collapsing, keyboard and saving';
export const order = 200;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  A <code>collapsible</code> panel collapses to its <code>collapsed-size</code> (0 by default) when
  it is dragged more than half way from its minimum towards that size, and a double-click or Enter
  on the divider collapses or restores it. <code>collapsed</code> reflects the state, and
  <code>size</code> keeps the size to restore. A panel collapsed to nothing takes its content out
  of the Tab order.
</p>

<p>
  Each divider is a focusable <code>role="separator"</code>. Its value is the size of the panel
  before it, and it is named after that panel's <code>label</code>. The arrow keys along the split
  move it by 1% (10% with Shift), Home and End move it to that panel's minimum and maximum, and
  Enter collapses or restores. <code>input</code> fires while a divider is dragged and
  <code>change</code> when the drag ends or a key moves it, with every panel's size in
  <code>detail.value</code>.
</p>

<p>
  Set <code>autosave</code> to a key and the layout is kept in local storage and restored on the
  next visit (when storage is unavailable the layout simply is not kept).
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-resizable-panels
    autosave='docs-collapsing-demo'
    style='height: 280px; border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); border-radius: 1rem;'
  >
    <wc-panel size='25' min-size='15' collapsible label='Folders'>
      <div style='padding: 1rem;'>Folders</div>
    </wc-panel>
    <wc-panel min-size='30' label='Files'>
      <div style='padding: 1rem;'>Files</div>
    </wc-panel>
    <wc-panel size='25' min-size='15' collapsible collapsed-size='4' label='Details'>
      <div style='padding: 1rem;'>Details</div>
    </wc-panel>
  </wc-resizable-panels>
</DemoComponentCard>
